<title>BELGIUM: Petrofina, Fina appoint advisors for merger.</title>
<headline>Petrofina, Fina appoint advisors for merger.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian oil group PetroFina and its U.S. unit Fina said in a statement on Tuesday they have chosen legal and financial advisors for their planned friendly merger.</p>
<p>Fina's Special Committe, comprising of independent members of its board, will be represented by Cravath, Swaine &amp; Moore of New York City. The Special Committee's financial advisor will be invetment banking firm Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The committee and its advisors will determine what they believe to be a fair price or range of prices for Fina Inc stock.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
